      "explanation": "q = 4.580.072/5.660.000 = 0,8092; s_q≈6.244,4; totaal 45.315.200; standaardfout circa 674.634,6. Eenzijdig 97,5%, t = 1,977: bovengrens circa €46.648.953.",
