        "Foutmarge: 1,663 × 74.543,55 = 123.965,92.",
        "Grenzen: 6.410.600 − 123.965,92 = 6.286.634,08 en 6.410.600 + 123.965,92 = 6.534.565,92.",
        "Naar buiten afgerond: [€6.286.000; €6.535.000]."
