        "Grenzen: 57.474.000 − 1,982 × 1.251.943 = 54.992.649 en 57.474.000 + 1,982 × 1.251.943 = 59.955.351.",
        "Naar buiten afgerond op € 1.000: [€ 54.992.000; € 59.956.000]."
